/Title (Step 4: Creating the Asset Details Report  1. Open the Corporate Asset Maintenance application.  2. Go to the Develop/Build section.  3. Select Report.  4. Create a new report using the Asset Details form as the data source. 5. Select a suitable report format such as a table/list report.  6. Name the report Asset Details Report.)
